# Local artifacts only. This file prevents accidental staging; it does not
# scan file contents. Keep ocloxy.py, README.md, LICENSE, the LaunchAgent plist,
# and the PR template tracked.

# Private feature/subfeature design notes
*.feature.md

# Local reference copies of third-party docs
markra docs/

